[00:06.98]'Member when we was broke?
[00:06.98]还记得咱穷得叮当响？
[00:10.68]I ain't have me a dollar, just some hope
[00:10.68]兜里空空如也，只剩希望
[00:14.43]Packed a bag full of clothes, hit the road
[00:14.43]打包几件衣裳，就奔向远方
[00:18.15]Told my mama not to worry anymore
[00:18.15]告诉老妈别再为我心慌
[00:22.95]I had to figure it out
[00:22.95]我只能靠自己闯荡
[00:24.84]I used to search in the couch for the ones
[00:24.84]从前翻遍沙发缝找钢镚响
[00:26.57]Now look at me, givin' 'em out
[00:26.57]如今看我随手就能帮
[00:28.39]My dreams, I'm livin' 'em out
[00:28.39]梦想成真，不再是空想
